747
00:46:48.139 --> 00:46:49.723
Come on in.

748
00:46:49.807 --> 00:46:51.224
No. I gotta go.

749
00:46:51.309 --> 00:46:54.144
I gotta go. too. to the bathroom. Come on.

750
00:46:54.729 --> 00:46:55.896
Come on.

751
00:46:55.980 --> 00:46:57.731
No. I gotta go.

752
00:46:57.815 --> 00:47:01.443
Look at this face.
Is that a face you could trust or what?

753
00:47:01.736 --> 00:47:05.906
Is it? They ought to stick this face
on a stamp. What do you think?

754
00:47:06.491 --> 00:47:08.074
Come on in.

755
00:47:13.664 --> 00:47:15.081
Yo. come on.

756
00:47:35.811 --> 00:47:37.020
Click.

757
00:47:42.652 --> 00:47:44.444
