758
00:47:44.529 --> 00:47:45.904
No.

759
00:47:45.988 --> 00:47:47.656
I got some things in there.

760
00:47:47.740 --> 00:47:50.617
If you like sodas. doughnuts or something.

761
00:47:50.785 --> 00:47:52.953
Got a couple cupcakes. Huh?

762
00:47:53.162 --> 00:47:54.246
No?

763
00:47:54.580 --> 00:47:57.123
I got some chocolate in there. No?

764
00:48:05.800 --> 00:48:07.717
Hot in here. you know?

765
00:48:09.804 --> 00:48:11.930
I could go for some music.

766
00:48:17.562 --> 00:48:18.979
Yo. Adrian.

767
00:48:19.397 --> 00:48:22.232
These are the exotic animals
I was telling you about.

768
00:48:22.316 --> 00:48:24.442
These are my friends. Cuff and Link.

769
00:48:24.527 --> 00:48:27.279
