-I know you sold them to me.

770
00:48:27.363 --> 00:48:29.864
Remember you were working
at that pet shop?

771
00:48:29.949 --> 00:48:33.410
First day you was there. and I came in
and bought both these animals?

772
00:48:33.494 --> 00:48:34.619
I remember that.

773
00:48:34.704 --> 00:48:38.415
I bought this bowl
and the animals themselves.

774
00:48:38.499 --> 00:48:41.084
Some food.
the marbles that go on the bottom there.

775
00:48:41.168 --> 00:48:43.128
Remember that mountain?

776
00:48:43.212 --> 00:48:47.382
I had to get rid of that mountain.
They kept fall over and flipping.

777
00:48:47.633 --> 00:48:49.384
(SOFT JAZZ MUSlC PLAYlNG)

778
00:48:50.803 --> 00:48:53.638
Why don't you come over here
and sit down?

779
00:48:55.850 --> 00:48:58.226
It's a nice couch. I don't know.

780
00:49:00.396 --> 00:49:03.481
There's big bugs in there.
It's safer over here.

781
00:49:06.068 --> 00:49:07.819
You wanna sit down?

782
00:49:14.535 --> 00:49:16.077
These your parents?

783
00:49:16.162 --> 00:49:18.413
Yeah. that's both of them there.

784
00:49:18.497 --> 00:49:21.166
-Is this you?
-Yeah. I was eight years old.

785
00:49:21.250 --> 00:49:24.336
That's the Italian Stallion
when he was a baby.

786
00:49:26.505 --> 00:49:29.716
Come on over.
Make yourself comfortable. Relax.

787
00:49:35.181 --> 00:49:36.473
