Well. you know. it's okay.
'cause you're my guest.

807
00:50:42.373 --> 00:50:45.375
I don't know you well enough.

808
00:50:45.459 --> 00:50:48.753
I've never been
in a man's apartment alone.

809
00:50:50.589 --> 00:50:53.425
Well. they're all the same. you know?

810
00:50:58.597 --> 00:51:01.182
I'm not sure I know you well enough.

811
00:51:02.560 --> 00:51:04.602
I don't feel comfortable.

812
00:51:04.770 --> 00:51:07.647
Yo. Adrian. I ain't so comfortable either.

813
00:51:10.067 --> 00:51:11.609
