-Don't tease me.
-I'm not teasing you.

824
00:51:54.862 --> 00:51:56.654
I ain't teasing you.

825
00:51:57.740 --> 00:52:00.366
I just wanna. . . I wanna kiss you.

826
00:52:02.995 --> 00:52:06.039
You don't have to kiss me back
if you don't wanna.

827
00:52:06.123 --> 00:52:07.957
but I wanna kiss you.

828
00:53:18.821 --> 00:53:19.904
(GASPING)

829
00:53:20.322 --> 00:53:23.408
MAN 1 : Heard you had a fight coming up.
MAN 2: Next month.

830
00:53:23.492 --> 00:53:25.243
January 27. right?

831
00:53:25.327 --> 00:53:27.245
That's good. Come down to the gym.

832
00:53:27.329 --> 00:53:29.622
We'll get you in shape.
How's your weight?

833
00:53:29.707 --> 00:53:32.584
-1 75.
-Hey. Rock. How you doing?

834
00:53:32.668 --> 00:53:34.836
Mick was looking for you up there. man.

835
00:53:34.920 --> 00:53:37.130
-For me? You're sure?
-Yeah. yeah.

836
00:53:37.214 --> 00:53:39.340
He's looking for you.
Get up there and see him.

837
00:53:39.425 --> 00:53:41.843
-He wanted me?
-Yeah. Your name's Rock. right?

838
00:53:41.927 --> 00:53:43.845
-ROCKY: Yeah.
-All right. Go on. babe.

839
