-I wanna know now!

849
00:54:25.512 --> 00:54:27.555
Okay. I'm gonna tell you !

850
00:54:27.640 --> 00:54:31.684
You had the talent to become
a good fighter. and instead of that.

851
00:54:31.769 --> 00:54:35.897
