852
00:54:36.815 --> 00:54:37.982
It's a living.

853
00:54:38.067 --> 00:54:39.901
It's a waste of life!

854
00:54:58.504 --> 00:55:00.296
Yes. May I help you?

855
00:55:05.552 --> 00:55:08.096
Oh. you must be Mr. Rocky Balboa.

856
00:55:08.180 --> 00:55:11.015
Mr. Jergens's expecting you.
Just a moment.

857
00:55:16.188 --> 00:55:18.606
Mr. Rocky Balboa to see you. sir.

858
00:55:19.149 --> 00:55:20.274
Fine.

859
00:55:21.026 --> 00:55:23.528
-Please go in. Mr. Balboa.
-Can I have that?

860
00:55:23.612 --> 00:55:26.030
-Oh. certainly.
-Thanks.

861
00:55:30.828 --> 00:55:32.203
Mr. Balboa.

862
00:55:32.955 --> 00:55:34.747
How are you? George Jergens.

863
00:55:34.832 --> 00:55:36.457
Take a chair. please.

864
00:55:36.542 --> 00:55:37.750
Thanks.

865
00:55:39.586 --> 00:55:41.004
Mr. Balboa.

866
00:55:41.547 --> 00:55:43.423
Call me Rocky.

867
00:55:43.507 --> 00:55:45.550
Rocky. you got any representation?

868
00:55:45.634 --> 00:55:47.135
