870
00:55:50.264 --> 00:55:54.058
Rocky. I've got a proposition
I'd like to make to you.

871
00:55:54.518 --> 00:55:57.687
-About sparring?
-Beg your pardon?

872
00:55:57.771 --> 00:56:02.233
I know you're looking for
sparring partners. and I'm very available.

873
00:56:02.443 --> 00:56:04.277
-I'm sure you are.
-Absolutely.

874
00:56:04.361 --> 00:56:05.862
Sparring with the champ
would be an honor.

875
00:56:05.946 --> 00:56:07.196
and you know what. Mr. Jergens?

876
00:56:07.281 --> 00:56:09.157
