882
00:56:26.717 --> 00:56:27.884
No.

883
00:56:27.968 --> 00:56:29.510
Listen. Rocky.

884
00:56:30.429 --> 00:56:32.430
Apollo's seen you fight.

885
00:56:33.265 --> 00:56:34.891
He likes you.

886
00:56:34.975 --> 00:56:36.726
