887
00:56:36.810 --> 00:56:38.603
Well. it's just that. you see.

888
00:56:38.687 --> 00:56:41.814
I fight in clubs. you know.
and I'm really a ham-and-egger.

889
00:56:41.899 --> 00:56:43.775
This guy. he's the best. and

890
00:56:43.859 --> 00:56:47.445
