892
00:56:49.490 --> 00:56:53.826
Rocky. do you believe that America
is the land of opportunity?

893
00:56:55.287 --> 00:56:56.454
Yeah.

894
00:56:57.206 --> 00:56:58.915
Apollo Creed does.

895
00:56:59.291 --> 00:57:01.250
and he's gonna prove it to the whole world

896
00:57:01.335 --> 00:57:04.045
by giving an unknown a shot at the title.

897
00:57:04.546 --> 00:57:06.547
And that unknown is you.

898
00:57:07.299 --> 00:57:09.133
He picked you. Rocky.

899
00:57:10.302 --> 00:57:12.595
It's the chance of a lifetime.

900
00:57:13.722 --> 00:57:15.640
You can't pass it by.

901
00:57:16.934 --> 00:57:18.559
What do you say?

902
00:57:24.441 --> 00:57:25.525
All right. fellas. That's enough pictures.

903
00:57:25.609 --> 00:57:27.443
We wanna ask Apollo a few questions.

904
00:57:27.528 --> 00:57:30.071
Apollo. how do you like
the City of Brotherly Love?

905
00:57:30.155 --> 00:57:33.574
APOLLO: Well. just being in Philadelphia
makes me feel patriotic.

906
00:57:33.659 --> 00:57:36.369
Beautiful people in a beautiful city
coming up to me on the street.

907
00:57:36.453 --> 00:57:37.620
wishing me the best.

908
00:57:37.704 --> 00:57:40.456
l love my Philadelphia brothers.
and l'm proud to be an American.

909
00:57:40.541 --> 00:57:42.083
REPORTER: Apollo? Champ?

910
00:57:42.167 --> 00:57:46.003
Why did you agree to fight a man
who has virtually no chance of winning?

911
00:57:46.088 --> 00:57:48.381
APOLLO: lf history proves one thing.

912
00:57:48.465 --> 00:57:52.218
American history proves that
everybody's got a chance to win.

913
00:57:52.302 --> 00:57:55.429
Didn't you guys ever hear
of Valley Forge or Bunker Hill?

914
00:57:55.514 --> 00:57:57.014
Apollo?

915
00:57:57.099 --> 00:57:59.642
lt is a coincidence
that you're fighting a white man

916
00:57:59.726 --> 00:58:01.686
on the most celebrated day
in the country's history?

917
00:58:01.770 --> 00:58:04.981
l don't know. ls it a coincidence
that he's fighting a black man

918
00:58:05.065 --> 00:58:07.400
on the most celebrated day
in the country's history?

919
00:58:07.484 --> 00:58:09.485
MAN 1 : Right on. Apollo!
MAN 2: Tell the truth. brother!

920
00:58:09.570 --> 00:58:12.155
REPORTER 1 : Listen. Apollo.
How do you feel about your challenger?

921
00:58:12.239 --> 00:58:14.991
How do l feel about him? Come here. Rock.

922
00:58:15.450 --> 00:58:16.784
My main man.

923
00:58:16.869 --> 00:58:19.537
-Rocky. ain't you ltalian?
-Yeah. I'm Italian.

924
00:58:19.621 --> 00:58:21.330
Now what does that mean?

925
00:58:21.415 --> 00:58:24.292
That means. if he can't fight.
l'll bet he can cook.

926
00:58:24.376 --> 00:58:25.543
(ALL LAUGHlNG)

927
00:58:26.003 --> 00:58:28.546
Do me a favor. His lungs. punch out.

928
00:58:28.630 --> 00:58:30.047
Paulie.

929
00:58:30.132 --> 00:58:33.342
Rocky. how do you expect
to fight Apollo Creed?

930
00:58:33.886 --> 00:58:36.137
Oh. jeez. you know. Creed's the best.

931
00:58:36.221 --> 00:58:37.889
l guess l'll have to do the best l can.

932
00:58:37.973 --> 00:58:40.641
Tell me. Rocky. just between us.

933
00:58:40.726 --> 00:58:43.769
where did you get
the name "ltalian Stallion"?

934
00:58:43.854 --> 00:58:48.274
Oh. l invented that about eight years ago
when l was eating dinner.

935
00:58:48.358 --> 00:58:53.154
Rocky. now your payday will be $1 50.000.

936
00:58:53.280 --> 00:58:54.697
Any comment?

937
00:58:56.909 --> 00:58:59.827
-You got no comment. Rocky. right?
-No.

938
00:58:59.912 --> 00:59:01.370
-Thank you. Rocky.
-Wait a minute.

939
00:59:01.455 --> 00:59:04.373
l just wanna say hi to my girlfriend. okay?

940
00:59:04.458 --> 00:59:06.542
Yo. Adrian. it's me. Rocky.

941
00:59:07.669 --> 00:59:10.421
You believe all this?
Microphones and all that stuff.

942
00:59:10.505 --> 00:59:11.631
You didn't.

943
00:59:11.715 --> 00:59:14.050
-Thank you. Rocky.
-Who you pushing. man?

944
00:59:14.134 --> 00:59:16.469
-Smack you in the mouth!
-Thank you. Rocky.

945
00:59:16.553 --> 00:59:18.429
Don't it matter he making you out a fool?

946
00:59:18.513 --> 00:59:20.097
I'd break his lips.

947
00:59:20.224 --> 00:59:23.851
-He's taking cheap shots.
-Don't bother me none.

948
00:59:23.936 --> 00:59:28.773
Yo. Rocky. I guess you'll be looking
for people to help you out.

949
00:59:28.857 --> 00:59:30.149
Help what?

950
00:59:30.234 --> 00:59:31.442
You know.

951
00:59:31.526 --> 00:59:33.444
keep you living the clean life.

952
00:59:33.528 --> 00:59:35.780
I do okay. you know.

953
00:59:35.864 --> 00:59:37.823
You need someone
to help with the exercise

954
00:59:37.908 --> 00:59:41.744
