or running errands?

955
00:59:41.828 --> 00:59:44.580
Hey. yo. Paulie.
who cared about me yesterday? Nobody.

956
00:59:44.665 --> 00:59:47.250
So I just think I'm gonna train myself.
you know?

957
00:59:47.334 --> 00:59:49.502
Without such good people around
to help you.

958
00:59:49.586 --> 00:59:52.046
you don't have such a good chance.

959
00:59:52.172 --> 00:59:54.757
Einstein flunked out of school twice.

960
00:59:55.092 --> 00:59:56.300
That so?

961
00:59:56.468 --> 01:00:00.346
Yeah. Beethoven was deaf.
Helen Keller was blind.

962
01:00:00.931 --> 01:00:03.349
I think Rocky's got a good chance.

963
