You looking to do a good deed?
Keep out of my freaking life!

966
01:00:15.904 --> 01:00:17.780
-What'd I do?
-Nothing.

967
01:00:17.864 --> 01:00:19.448
Did I say something wrong?

968
01:00:19.533 --> 01:00:21.284
You didn't say nothing. It's all right.

969
01:00:21.368 --> 01:00:23.369
That's right! You didn't say nothing !

970
01:00:23.453 --> 01:00:24.996
Nothing at all !

971
01:00:26.999 --> 01:00:28.416
I gotta go.

972
01:00:29.584 --> 01:00:31.961
PAULIE: Where are the freaking pretzels?

973
01:00:35.007 --> 01:00:36.966
I'd like to have a pretzel.

974
01:00:37.050 --> 01:00:39.135
Hey. we ain't got any beer?

975
01:00:40.012 --> 01:00:43.180
I thought you were supposed to
pick up some beer!

976
01:00:51.023 --> 01:00:53.649
How'd you like hearing your name
