01:40:44.664 --> 01:40:45.997
Good luck.

1460
01:40:46.791 --> 01:40:50.085
Adrian. you don't think
this robe is too baggy. huh?

1461
01:40:50.294 --> 01:40:51.628
Good luck.

1462
01:40:51.713 --> 01:40:53.338
Don't leave town.

1463
01:40:55.717 --> 01:40:59.344
ANNOUNCER: l'd like you to meet
my colleague. Stu Nahan.

1464
01:40:59.429 --> 01:41:00.804
Thank you. Bill Baldwin.

1465
01:41:00.888 --> 01:41:03.640
The electricity is all over the place tonight.
as Rocky Balboa...

1466
01:41:05.560 --> 01:41:07.394
What is that?

1467
01:41:07.478 --> 01:41:09.813
I trained you to be a fighter.
not a billboard.

1468
01:41:09.897 --> 01:41:12.482
-I'm doing it for a friend.
-What do you get out of it?

1469
01:41:12.567 --> 01:41:14.484
Paulie gets $3.000. I get the robe.

1470
01:41:14.569 --> 01:41:15.777
Shrewd.

1471
01:41:16.362 --> 01:41:19.030
The story about tonight's fight.
their difference in style.

1472
01:41:19.115 --> 01:41:21.366
you can quote
a recent sports magazine which said.

1473
01:41:21.451 --> 01:41:23.493
it could be
"the caveman against the cavalier."

1474
01:41:23.578 --> 01:41:25.495
l notice a buzzing in the background.

1475
01:41:25.580 --> 01:41:28.165
Could be the challenger
is getting ready to get into the ring.

1476
01:41:28.249 --> 01:41:30.417
Rocky. look at my date.

1477
01:41:30.501 --> 01:41:32.502
-Cost me $200.
-$250.

1478
01:41:32.587 --> 01:41:34.254
I gotta go. I gotta work.

1479
01:41:34.338 --> 01:41:36.673
-How's the robe?
-A little baggy.

1480
01:41:36.758 --> 01:41:39.676
A 50-to-1 underdog
living a Cinderella story.

1481
01:41:39.761 --> 01:41:43.472
and he's captured people's imaginations
all over the world.

1482
01:41:48.019 --> 01:41:49.770
WOMAN: We love you. Rocky!

1483
01:41:50.104 --> 01:41:52.939
-Good luck. champ.
-Thanks for showing up.

1484
01:41:53.441 --> 01:41:55.358
NAHAN: And his record. 44 victories.

1485
01:41:55.443 --> 01:41:58.028
He's had 38 by knockout.
and he's lost 20 fights.

1486
01:41:58.112 --> 01:42:00.489
BALDWIN: Which makes me wonder.
can he stand it?

1487
01:42:00.573 --> 01:42:03.200
You know. the stamina and the skill
to last three rounds.

1488
01:42:03.284 --> 01:42:05.243
Because Las Vegas odds say no.

1489
01:42:05.328 --> 01:42:08.163
Rocky Balboa. climbing into the ring now.

1490
01:42:08.873 --> 01:42:10.373
"The ltalian Stallion."

1491
01:42:10.458 --> 01:42:14.377
Some meat sign on the back of his robe.
You seen what that was?

1492
01:42:14.462 --> 01:42:16.463
Shamrock Meat...

1493
01:42:16.547 --> 01:42:19.716
There's a lot of noise
coming from the background.

1494
01:42:20.218 --> 01:42:22.886
-They have spotlights.
-Am l seeing right back there?

1495
01:42:22.970 --> 01:42:26.431
ls that the world heavyweight champion.
Apollo Creed?

1496
01:42:26.516 --> 01:42:30.560
He's riding in a boat.
ls he supposed to be George Washington?

1497
01:42:30.645 --> 01:42:33.897
Obviously so.
He's got the hat on. the whole thing.

1498
01:42:35.399 --> 01:42:37.984
The world champion. Apollo Creed

1499
01:42:38.069 --> 01:42:40.904
is doing an imitation
of George Washington.

1500
01:42:41.864 --> 01:42:43.573
He's throwing money.

1501
01:42:43.658 --> 01:42:47.077
Remember when we were growing up.
we were taught about George Washington

1502
01:42:47.161 --> 01:42:48.578
throwing a dollar.

1503
01:42:48.663 --> 01:42:51.414
lf you threw a dollar in those days.
it went a lot farther.

1504
01:42:51.499 --> 01:42:54.209
Now he's taking his...
Blonde wig came off.

1505
01:42:54.293 --> 01:42:55.919
The hat came off.

1506
01:42:56.003 --> 01:42:57.212
(CROWD CHEERING)

1507
01:42:57.296 --> 01:42:58.672
I want you !

1508
01:42:59.924 --> 01:43:02.425
The crowd is loving every minute of it.

1509
01:43:02.510 --> 01:43:05.554
-Here is the world heavyweight champion.
-Apollo Creed.

1510
01:43:05.638 --> 01:43:07.055
For you around the world

1511
01:43:07.139 --> 01:43:10.058
he was dressed as George Washington.
the father of our country.

1512
01:43:10.142 --> 01:43:11.518
I want you !

1513
01:43:14.272 --> 01:43:17.774
l don't believe what l'm seeing.
Uncle Sam himself!

1514
01:43:17.859 --> 01:43:19.401
I want you !

1515
01:43:19.485 --> 01:43:22.320
I want all of you !

1516
01:43:22.905 --> 01:43:24.781
He looks like a big flag.

1517
01:43:24.866 --> 01:43:26.908
I want you !

1518
01:43:28.077 --> 01:43:30.370
-Is he talking to me?
-He's talking to you.

1519
01:43:30.454 --> 01:43:32.622
-Is he talking to me?
-Let him talk.

1520
01:43:32.707 --> 01:43:34.499
I want the Stallion !

1521
01:43:35.167 --> 01:43:37.460
NAHAN: He says. "l want the Stallion."

1522
01:43:38.963 --> 01:43:41.965
For you in foreign countries.
during World War l.

1523
01:43:42.049 --> 01:43:44.968
the picture of Uncle Sam
with his finger pointed like that

1524
01:43:45.052 --> 01:43:47.470
was a recruiting poster
for our fellows in the service.

1525
01:43:47.555 --> 01:43:49.764
the army and the navy. "l want you."

1526
01:43:49.849 --> 01:43:51.933
BALDWlN: That's what
he's doing a take on.

1527
01:43:52.018 --> 01:43:55.270
He's yelling. "Creed in three."

1528
01:43:55.354 --> 01:43:57.480
What do you think that outfit cost?

1529
01:43:58.149 --> 01:43:59.482
(TRUMPET BLOWlNG)

1530
01:44:07.867 --> 01:44:10.035
Ladies and gentlemen.

1531
01:44:10.745 --> 01:44:14.623
Good evening. A very Happy New Year.

1532
01:44:14.707 --> 01:44:16.708
Welcome to Philadelphia.

1533
01:44:16.792 --> 01:44:19.544
BALDWlN: Everybody who's anybody
is here tonight.

1534
01:44:21.756 --> 01:44:25.175
ANNOUNCER: Time does not permit me
to introduce

1535
01:44:25.509 --> 01:44:28.678
the many luminaries of politics.

1536
01:44:28.763 --> 01:44:33.183
show business and the sporting world
who are with us tonight

1537
01:44:33.517 --> 01:44:35.685
but l would like to present

1538
01:44:35.770 --> 01:44:38.813
one of the immortals of pugilism.

1539
01:44:38.898 --> 01:44:42.525
a champion in and out of the ring.

1540
01:44:42.610 --> 01:44:45.362
Philadelphia's own "Smokin' Joe."

1541
01:44:45.446 --> 01:44:48.281
the beloved Mr. Joe Frazier!

1542
01:44:48.532 --> 01:44:50.033
(ALL CHEERING)

1543
01:44:59.043 --> 01:45:00.335
How you doing?

1544
01:45:00.419 --> 01:45:01.836
Don't hurt him. okay?

1545
01:45:01.921 --> 01:45:03.546
I'll try not to.

1546
01:45:03.631 --> 01:45:06.007
BALDWlN: What a credit he's been
in his career as a fighter.

1547
01:45:06.092 --> 01:45:08.218
Now he's coming over
to talk to the champ.

1548
01:45:08.302 --> 01:45:10.720
-Hey. Joe.
-You been ducking me a long time.

1549
01:45:10.805 --> 01:45:12.472
No. Joe. You're next.

1550
01:45:12.556 --> 01:45:14.766
-You're next.
-You understand?

1551
01:45:15.309 --> 01:45:16.893
They must be friends.

1552
01:45:18.896 --> 01:45:20.271
(CROWD CHEERING)

1553
01:45:25.277 --> 01:45:27.112
Joe Frazier!

1554
01:45:27.196 --> 01:45:29.406
-NAHAN: Fight fans. get settled down.
-Go home!

1555
01:45:29.490 --> 01:45:32.617
-Don't stay in the arena!
-lt won't be long now.

1556
01:45:32.910 --> 01:45:33.994
(BELL CLANGS)

1557
01:45:34.078 --> 01:45:37.539
Now for the main event.

1558
01:45:41.252 --> 01:45:42.877
On my left

1559
01:45:42.962 --> 01:45:46.089
the challenger. in white trunks.

1560
01:45:46.173 --> 01:45:49.300
weighing 1 90 pounds.

1561
01:45:49.385 --> 01:45:51.886
Philadelphia's favorite son.

1562
01:45:51.971 --> 01:45:54.806
The ltalian Stallion.

1563
01:45:54.890 --> 01:45:56.975
Rocky Balboa.

1564
01:45:57.309 --> 01:45:58.518
(CROWD CHEERING)

1565
01:46:02.648 --> 01:46:03.815
(BELL CLANGS)

1566
01:46:03.983 --> 01:46:06.276
And on my right

1567
01:46:06.360 --> 01:46:08.820
wearing red. white and blue.

1568
01:46:08.904 --> 01:46:11.990
weighing 21 0 pounds.

1569
01:46:12.074 --> 01:46:15.493
undefeated in 46 fights.

1570
01:46:15.828 --> 01:46:18.329
The Master of Disaster.

1571
01:46:18.789 --> 01:46:22.500
the undisputed heavyweight champion
of the world.

1572
01:46:22.585 --> 01:46:24.377
Apollo Creed!

1573
01:46:24.670 --> 01:46:26.004
(CROWD CHEERING)

1574
01:46:26.172 --> 01:46:28.715
I want you ! You !

1575
01:46:31.427 --> 01:46:34.262
APOLLO: You. chump. I want you !

1576
01:46:34.346 --> 01:46:37.348
REFEREE: You've both fought in
Philadelphia before. You know the rules.

1577
01:46:37.433 --> 01:46:40.560
No low blows.
watch your heads. no butting.

1578
01:46:40.644 --> 01:46:42.395
Shake hands and come out fighting.

1579
01:46:42.480 --> 01:46:44.147
Put your hands up there. chump.

1580
01:46:44.231 --> 01:46:46.357
-Come out fighting.
-Come on !

1581
01:46:48.360 --> 01:46:53.239
BALDWlN: Rocky's just going over
and being calm. it looks like from here.

1582
01:46:54.366 --> 01:46:56.284
There goes the big hat.

1583
01:46:59.747 --> 01:47:03.333
NAHAN: l've never seen a fighter
that concerned about his hair.

1584
01:47:03.417 --> 01:47:04.501
(BALDWIN LAUGHING)

1585
01:47:11.383 --> 01:47:13.718
BALDWlN: There's the bell for round one.

1586
01:47:15.179 --> 01:47:19.307
The fighters come in the center of the ring.
looking at each other.

1587
01:47:19.391 --> 01:47:22.852
Creed. the champion.
zipping in those left-handed jabs.

1588
01:47:22.937 --> 01:47:24.854
Right there. Bang.

1589
01:47:26.482 --> 01:47:29.692
The champ stinging the slower challenger
with jabs at will.

1590
01:47:29.777 --> 01:47:33.738
ln fact. it looks like Rocky
is blocking the blows with his face.

1591
01:47:33.823 --> 01:47:38.243
The champion doesn't look the best
he's ever been. but he's moving now.

1592
01:47:38.327 --> 01:47:42.247
NAHAN: The champion's smiling now.
He's toying with him.

1593
01:47:43.082 --> 01:47:46.000
Trying to give the fans
their money's worth.

1594
01:47:47.670 --> 01:47:51.131
He's very clearly outclassed
the challenger right now.

1595
01:47:53.300 --> 01:47:57.262
He's trying to make his man miss like that.

1596
01:47:58.764 --> 01:48:01.391
The champ is just taunting him.

1597
01:48:04.270 --> 01:48:06.104
Creed dancing around.

1598
01:48:07.523 --> 01:48:09.357
l don't believe this!

1599
01:48:09.441 --> 01:48:11.818
The champ is down!

1600
01:48:12.111 --> 01:48:13.486
(CROWD CHEERING)

1601
01:48:17.908 --> 01:48:19.159
Creed is down!

1602
01:48:19.243 --> 01:48:21.202
What a surprise this is!

1603
01:48:22.371 --> 01:48:25.707
This is the first time the champion
has ever been knocked down.

1604
01:48:25.749 --> 01:48:28.001
The referee is giving him the count.

1605
01:48:28.085 --> 01:48:30.920
Six. seven. eight.

1606
01:48:31.005 --> 01:48:33.882
He appears to be all right.
Glassy-eyed but okay.

1607
01:48:34.258 --> 01:48:37.427
MICKEY: Go to the ribs!
Go to work. Rock!

1608
01:48:37.553 --> 01:48:39.053
Come on !

1609
01:48:40.347 --> 01:48:43.558
Rocky coming back out.
and he's like a bull in a china closet.

1610
01:48:43.601 --> 01:48:46.561
He really wants it. Apollo. left to the head.

1611
01:48:46.687 --> 01:48:50.356
The champion's coming off the floor

1612
01:48:50.441 --> 01:48:52.525
and he's trying to put him away.

1613
01:48:52.610 --> 01:48:54.110
A left. a right.

1614
01:48:54.236 --> 01:48:57.697
Combinations into the face!
That's the Apollo we know.

1615
01:49:01.785 --> 01:49:05.121
Now the champ is taunting Rocky
to come and get some more.

1616
01:49:05.247 --> 01:49:06.873
A left. Another.

1617
01:49:07.374 --> 01:49:08.875
Another left.

1618
01:49:10.294 --> 01:49:12.128
Rocky's coming back!

1619
01:49:13.589 --> 01:49:16.466
Rocky's got him on the ropes!

1620
01:49:17.301 --> 01:49:18.801
Let's break it.

1621
01:49:20.304 --> 01:49:21.804
You're holding.

1622
01:49:21.931 --> 01:49:23.723
You're posing as a boxer.

1623
01:49:23.807 --> 01:49:26.893
There's no way we expected
this kind of hitting.

1624
01:49:27.269 --> 01:49:28.561
