1625
01:49:29.980 --> 01:49:32.065
Do your best. Do your best.

1626
01:49:34.443 --> 01:49:38.154
Apollo unloading a left.
He's got him up against the ropes.

1627
01:49:38.280 --> 01:49:39.405
(CROWD CHEERING)

1628
01:49:39.490 --> 01:49:40.573
(BELL DINGS)

1629
