They're leading him to his corner.
Rocky can't find his way.

1630
01:49:50.751 --> 01:49:52.126
I called it!

1631
01:49:52.169 --> 01:49:54.754
-Your nose is broke.
-How's it look?

1632
01:49:54.838 --> 01:49:56.339
It's an improvement.

1633
01:49:56.423 --> 01:49:59.676
Quit shucking and jiving ! Stick and move!

1634
01:49:59.760 --> 01:50:03.221
Go for the ribs.
Don't let that bastard breathe.

1635
01:50:03.347 --> 01:50:04.639
The guy's quick.

1636
01:50:04.682 --> 01:50:05.807
(BUZZER SOUNDING)

1637
01:50:05.849 --> 01:50:08.643
He doesn't know it's a damn show.
He thinks it's a damn fight.

1638
01:50:08.686 --> 01:50:11.396
Finish this bum. and let's go home.

1639
01:50:12.398 --> 01:50:14.816
Stay to the body. You're doing great!

1640
01:50:14.858 --> 01:50:18.069
Round two.
Creed predicted he'd win it in three.

1641
01:50:18.195 --> 01:50:21.739
Creed got knocked down in the first.
He came back strong.

1642
01:50:22.074 --> 01:50:23.741
He's working now.

1643
01:50:24.201 --> 01:50:26.911
A sharp left. Again. a hard right.

1644
01:50:27.037 --> 01:50:29.539
Now coming in.
He's knocked him into the corner again.

1645
01:50:29.581 --> 01:50:32.083
The champion's got him
backed into the corner.

1646
01:50:32.209 --> 01:50:36.087
Pummeling him left and right.
his head bouncing against the ropes.

1647
01:50:37.006 --> 01:50:40.049
Balboa's taking
a tremendous beating here.

1648
01:50:40.175 --> 01:50:43.720
Battering him like a punching bag.
What's keeping him up?

1649
01:50:46.056 --> 01:50:47.557
Can't you fight?

1650
01:50:47.599 --> 01:50:50.893
Stop clowning around
and give the people something !

1651
01:50:51.562 --> 01:50:53.896
-Come on !
-He says he wants more!

1652
01:50:53.939 --> 01:50:56.733
He wants more. You folks
watching television around the world

1653
01:50:56.859 --> 01:50:58.901
you're watching a battle.

1654
01:51:03.615 --> 01:51:06.951
Balboa trying to fight back.
Oh. he tagged the champ!

1655
01:51:07.077 --> 01:51:10.580
The champion is trying to get out of there.
but he can't do it.

1656
01:51:10.622 --> 01:51:14.542
He is being barraged with lefts and rights
to the head and body.

1657
01:51:14.585 --> 01:51:17.754
Balboa is tagging the champion
right on the kisser!

1658
01:51:17.796 --> 01:51:18.963
(BELL DINGS)

1659
01:51:19.089 --> 01:51:22.300
The referee steps in.
They're ready to keep going.

1660
01:51:22.718 --> 01:51:24.552
Back to your corners!

1661
01:51:25.137 --> 01:51:27.096
Come on. Creed !

1662
01:51:27.806 --> 01:51:30.099
This is gonna be a tough one.

1663
01:52:24.696 --> 01:52:27.031
-Back with a left!
-He got tagged!

1664
01:52:28.659 --> 01:52:31.202
The referee's wiping off the gloves.

1665
01:52:36.417 --> 01:52:38.751
Hard left and right combination!

1666
01:52:38.836 --> 01:52:41.754
-What is keeping him up. Bill?
-l don't know.

1667
01:52:43.715 --> 01:52:47.009
He can't even get his gloves up
to protect himself.

1668
01:52:54.435 --> 01:52:56.519
Down ! Stay down !

1669
01:52:56.603 --> 01:52:58.896
Apollo has his arms in the air!

1670
01:53:09.950 --> 01:53:11.075
Five.

1671
01:53:12.369 --> 01:53:13.453
Six.

1672
01:53:14.037 --> 01:53:15.246
Seven.

1673
01:53:15.372 --> 01:53:16.539
Eight.

1674
01:53:16.915 --> 01:53:18.040
Nine.

1675
01:53:24.882 --> 01:53:26.132
Come on !

1676
01:53:27.426 --> 01:53:29.427
Apollo can't believe it.

1677
01:53:42.983 --> 01:53:44.484
(BELL DINGS)

1678
01:53:46.195 --> 01:53:49.405
The champion got a left to his right ribs.

1679
01:53:49.781 --> 01:53:51.991
This has been a tremendous...

1680
01:53:57.789 --> 01:53:58.956
Okay. champ?

1681
01:53:59.041 --> 01:54:00.333
Yeah. I'm okay.

1682
01:54:00.417 --> 01:54:03.044
I may have broke my ribs.

1683
01:54:03.128 --> 01:54:05.588
I can't see nothing. Gotta open my eye.

1684
01:54:05.672 --> 01:54:07.590
-Cut me.
-Don't wanna do it.

1685
01:54:07.674 --> 01:54:10.176
-Go ahead. Cut me.
-Okay.

1686
01:54:10.260 --> 01:54:11.802
Try it. Cut it.

1687
01:54:12.262 --> 01:54:14.138
CROWD: Creed ! Creed !

1688
01:54:14.306 --> 01:54:15.765
(CROWD CHANTING)

1689
01:54:16.099 --> 01:54:17.308
Oh. God.

1690
01:54:17.392 --> 01:54:20.186
You're bleeding inside.
