1691
01:54:20.270 --> 01:54:23.564
You ain't stopping nothing. man.

1692
01:54:23.774 --> 01:54:26.234
You stop this fight. I'll kill you !

1693
01:54:27.611 --> 01:54:29.779
-I'm going.
-If you wanna go.

1694
01:54:30.989 --> 01:54:33.324
You gotta give it all !

1695
01:54:33.450 --> 01:54:35.368
You gotta get him !

1696
01:54:40.832 --> 01:54:42.792
The 1 5th and final round.

1697
01:54:42.876 --> 01:54:45.878
CROWD: Rocky! Rocky! Rocky!

1698
01:54:51.718 --> 01:54:54.345
They look like they've been in a war.

1699
01:55:01.979 --> 01:55:05.356
A hard right.
The champion really tagged him.

1700
01:55:05.440 --> 01:55:09.402
Apollo clearly protecting
his right side. his ribs.

1701
01:55:12.823 --> 01:55:14.615
Body punches!

1702
01:55:14.700 --> 01:55:18.119
Hard lefts and rights. Look at the blood
coming out of his mouth!

